# Inverting op-amp stage. The first circuit with feedback: Rf runs backwards
# from the output to the inverting input, which is the "bridge" pattern and
# the shape that currently draws Rfb_R shorted.
net IN
net OUT
net GND
net 12V
net -12V
part 1k:Rin
part 10k:Rf
part TL074:U1A
IN -> Rin@1
Rin@2 -> U1A@2
U1A@2 -> Rf@1
Rf@2 -> U1A@1
U1A@1 -> OUT
U1A@3 -> GND
U1A@4 -> 12V
U1A@11 -> -12V
